(7743893, 1277773, 163081, '<td valign="top">Finally, pure street photography. I like the distance between the 2 people. Far from each but close to each other. I just wonder who''s cup it is? I''ll give you my Blue Dragon Award. <a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1173261" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173261.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173261.jpg'', strrpos(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/160000-164999/163081/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1173261.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a></td>', 'Finally, pure street photography. I like the distance between the 2 people. Far from each but close to each other. I just wonder who''s cup it is? I''ll give you my Blue Dragon Award. ', '2023-05-07 15:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
