(7743961, 1277759, 30049, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry.  I know this is probably a major nitpik but those dead branches are SO distracting from this scene.  See that tuft of grass that''s all lit up just past the tree?  That sun streaming valley in the background?  Put those two together with a low to the ground angle, and Kapow!  Again, my apologies for picking this image apart.  It is a lovely scene.  Good luck.</td>', 'I''m sorry.  I know this is probably a major nitpik but those dead branches are SO distracting from this scene.  See that tuft of grass that''s all lit up just past the tree?  That sun streaming valley in the background?  Put those two together with a low to the ground angle, and Kapow!  Again, my apologies for picking this image apart.  It is a lovely scene.  Good luck.', '2023-05-07 23:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
