(7744035, 1277805, 35078, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by glad2badad:</b></div><hr/><i> Hmm.  Sorry about the 1200 comment.  Looking at this on another computer this morning and it''s showing full size.  I need to figure out why (on my other PC). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Unfortunately the image looks very poor at full size on PC. I uploaded it from my phone at severely reduced quality. I didn''t realize how bad it was until I viewed it on my PC after it was already in the voting period. It looked fine on my phone. The original is fine looking at it on my PC. From now on, I''ll only submit entries from my PC. One of the worst placinings I''ve had and I was particularly pleased with this image as I''d gone to a lot of effort to capture it. Very difficult to get a single image with the stars and a lot of conflicting light. Lesson learned. That''s what this site is about. Learning and improving :)</td>', 'Originally posted by glad2badad: Hmm.  Sorry about the 1200 comment.  Looking at this on another computer this morning and it''s showing full size.  I need to figure out why (on my other PC).   Unfortunately the image looks very poor at full size on PC. I uploaded it from my phone at severely reduced quality. I didn''t realize how bad it was until I viewed it on my PC after it was already in the voting period. It looked fine on my phone. The original is fine looking at it on my PC. From now on, I''ll only submit entries from my PC. One of the worst placinings I''ve had and I was particularly pleased with this image as I''d gone to a lot of effort to capture it. Very difficult to get a single image with the stars and a lot of conflicting light. Lesson learned. That''s what this site is about. Learning and improving :)', '2023-05-08 12:00:16.000000', NULL, 0),
